## Test & scenario review for the new Mapping UI (+ local e2e domain seeding)

Context: Reviewed unit, e2e and scenario suites against the new Graph →
Management → Mapping page (Informations / Visual / List tabs, Build →
Mapping → Overview order, Visual↔List selection sync). Running the e2e
suites locally (`ONTOBRICKS_E2E_FAKE_CREDS=1`) showed that every workspace
URL (`/dtwin`, `/mapping`, `/ontology`, `/domain`) 303'd to Home because the
`page` fixture only seeded a session domain in live mode — 85 local e2e
failures, and the passing ones were partly asserting against the landing
page. Fixing that surfaced a few real stale tests and one real mobile bug.

Changes:
1. tests/e2e/conftest.py, pytest.ini, pyproject.toml
   New `needs_domain` marker: the `page` fixture seeds a session-only
   domain (`ZzE2eLive`) for marked tests in local mode too (live mode
   unchanged — it always seeds).
2. tests/e2e/mapping/test_mapping_flows.py
   Rewritten for the new UI (13 tests): sidebar order Build → Mapping →
   Overview with label "Mapping" and no `information`/`manual` items;
   default Informations tab; legacy `/mapping/`, `?section=information`,
   `?section=manual` redirects land on the right `tab`; tab clicks sync
   `?tab=` and hide the bottom panel on Informations only; R2RML
   import/export; Auto-Map modal (skipped when no LLM endpoint); Build
   Diagnostics modal; with an injected two-class ontology — Visual is
   centered on render, Visual click selects the List row, List click
   selects the Visual node, `selectInTree` expands collapsed parents.
   Removed the stale `information` section parametrization.
3. tests/e2e/navigation/test_navigation_flows.py,
   tests/e2e/navigation/test_sidebar_bottom_alignment.py,
   tests/e2e/dtwin/test_dtwin_flows.py, tests/e2e/domain/*.py,
   tests/e2e/ontology/{class_crud,import,information,owl_export,
