## Explorer groups toggle + Intelligence Graph-ready badges

Context: Graph → Explorer already had expand/collapse-all in the Groups popup
and canvas menu, but Ontology → Studio exposes a single toolbar toggle.
Intelligence section titles (except Analytics and Cohorts) had no Graph-ready
badge, so users could not see whether the graph was built before running
communities, patterns, or simulations.

Changes:
1. src/front/templates/partials/dtwin/_query_sigmagraph.html
   Added `#sgToggleAllGroupsBtn` in the Explorer toolbar (Studio-style single
   collapse/expand toggle) next to zoom.
2. src/front/static/query/js/query-sigmagraph.js
   Wired `toggleAllGroups` to existing collapseAll/expandAll; the button flips
   icon/title/aria-pressed and is disabled when no groups exist.
3. Intelligence section titles now include `_kg_status_indicator.html`:
   communities, patterns list/details, scenarios, workbench, compare.
4. src/front/templates/intelligence.html + query-sync.js
   Load query-sync.js so Intelligence badges fill. Pages without Build still
   probe `/dtwin/sync/status`. Go to Build on Intelligence navigates to
   `/dtwin/?section=sync`.
5. Help Center + user-guide: Explorer toolbar groups toggle.
6. Unit contracts for the toggle, Intelligence includes, and the status probe.

